[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: the transform of a y-sorted TileMapLayer, rotated 30 degrees and scaled 1.5.
; Each tile row draws through the layer's whole transform and sorts by the y of its origin in the
; parent's space, so the two tall white bars interleave with the rows: each covers the rows whose
; origin lies above its own and hides under the rows whose origin lies below it.

